10y+2+y=3(2+y)y
\Rightarrow 11y+2=6y+3y^{2}
\Rightarrow -3y^{2}+5y+2=0
\Rightarrow 3y^{2}-5y-2=0 \text{ (-১ দ্বারা গুণ করে)}
\Rightarrow 3y^{2}-6y+y-2=0
\Rightarrow 3y(y-2)+1(y-2)=0
\Rightarrow (y-2)(3y+1)=0
\therefore y=2 \text{ অথবা, } y=-\frac{1}{3}

